### Database

With `postgresql.enabled: true` the chart runs PostgreSQL on the official
`postgres` image (StatefulSet, Service and Secret) and TeslaMate, TeslaMateApi
and TeslaMate Agile read `DATABASE_PASS` from its Secret. Set
`postgresql.auth.password` or `postgresql.auth.existingSecret` (key `password`).
With it disabled, set the `DATABASE_*` env vars for an external database.

**Upgrading from 2.x:** the Bitnami `postgresql` subchart was removed (Bitnami's
free images are only published as `latest`). Its values and data layout are not
compatible; dump the database before upgrading and restore it into the new
StatefulSet (see the TeslaMate backup and restore docs).
{{- end -}}